{
  "bookId": "rewind-47",
  "id": "chapter-193",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "39416001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "一个奔跑的女孩扑进了伊迪丝的怀里，打断了她的回忆——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "对不起对不起，我不是故意的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "啊，是大姐姐！你有没有哪里受伤？快让我看看吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "无碍，一点小伤，不用担心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "你是附近谁家的孩子，怎么一个人在这里玩耍？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "听说大哥哥回来了，我要回家去见大哥哥~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "嘿嘿，偷偷告诉你哦，大哥哥的眼睛里住着小星星呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "这孩子的眼神，很像当年的罗威……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "少年罗威",
          "text": "我看到了，在您的眼中，闪烁着奥古斯都璀璨的星海。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "少年罗威",
          "text": "我会永远忠于您，协助您完成宏伟的志向。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "大姐姐？唔，你还好吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "没什么，你让我想起了一位朋友。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "诶，大姐姐的朋友是什么样的人呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "一个和你一样喜欢「星星」的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "哇，有机会真想见见大姐姐的这位朋友呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "听闻附近的治安不是很好，我不放心你一个人跑来跑去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "小家伙，你愿意相信我，让我送你回家吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39416018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "女孩",
          "text": "当然当然~爸爸妈妈见到大姐姐一定会很开心的~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-962",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "guanjia",
          "rowIds": [
            39416001,
            39416002,
            39416003,
